    "number": 21,
    "summary": "Paul journeys to Jerusalem—He is persecuted, arrested, and bound.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass, that after we were gotten from them, and had launched, we came with a straight course unto Coos, and the day following unto Rhodes, and from thence unto Patara:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 126,
            "end": 129
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 21:1",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And finding a ship sailing over unto Phenicia, we went aboard, and set forth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 21:2",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Now when we had discovered Cyprus, we left it on the left hand, and sailed into Syria, and landed at Tyre: for there the ship was to unlade her burden.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 21:3",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "And finding disciples, we tarried there seven days: who said to Paul through the Spirit, that he should not go up to Jerusalem.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 81,
            "end": 87,
            "text": "D&C 38:33."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "D&C 38:33.",
            "prettyString": "D&C 38:33",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "doctrineandcovenants",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 38,
                    "end": 38,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 33,
                        "end": 33
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 21:4",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And when we had accomplished those days, we departed and went our way; and they all brought us on our way, with wives and children, till we were out of the city: and we kneeled down on the shore, and prayed.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 137,
            "end": 144
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 21:5",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And when we had taken our leave one of another, we took ship; and they returned home again.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 21:6",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And when we had finished our course from Tyre, we came to Ptolemais, and saluted the brethren, and abode with them one day.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 28
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Acts 21:7",
        "book": "Acts",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
